# Hybrid variant: monodomainSolver + restitutionEikonalSolver1D.
#
# This probe reads -1 through t=0.03 and activates at t=0.035, then holds
# 0.0316724 flat for the rest of the run. Sampled at the run's own endTime,
# comfortably past activation.
#
# 2026-09-15: was 0.0313331. The Stewart Purkinje calibration was replaced by
# reproducible measurement (see the cable tutorial's
# Purkinje_S1_S2_Calibration.md), which moved the fully recovered conduction
# velocity from 3.37 to 3.3280 m/s. This case paces one beat from rest, so
# every node activates for the first time: the activation interval is
# unbounded, acceptance always passes, and the diastolic interval clamps to
# the CV table's maximum. That maximum is therefore the only calibration
# constant this reference is sensitive to - apdNominal, minimumDI90 and
# escapeInterval do not affect it - and a 1.2% slower Purkinje velocity delays
# this junction by 0.34 ms, 3.4x the tolerance below.
#
# file                                  time   col  expected      tolerance
injectionProbe/0/activationTime         0.04   2    0.0316724     1e-4
